					<p class="body1" align="left"><span class="body1 style73"> <h2>News archive</h2><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-09-20 | Thursday</font></strong><br><br><img src="http://therapup.rawkus.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/09/blue-magic.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="202" /><br /><br /><u><strong>Jay-Z - Blue Magic (feat. Pharrell):</strong></u><br />http://rapidshare.com/files/57139371/Jay-Z_-_Blue_Magic__radio_.MP3<br /><br />Shouts out to En Vogue...<br /><br />Peace<br />daps1<br /><p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-09-20 | Thursday</font></strong><br><br><strong>SEPTEMBER 20, 2007</strong><br /><br />Today is a national day of solidarity with the <strong>Jena 6</strong> (if you don&#39;t know, here&#39;s a <a href="http://www.colorofchange.org/jena/message.html">late late pass</a>). Seattle shows its support at <strong>5pm outside of Westlake Mall</strong> (4th &amp; Pine). Come through. Wear black.<br /><br />---------------------<br /><br />Barbara Murphy, Jena Town Librarian, White:<br />&quot;We don&#39;t have a race problem. It&#39;s not black against white. It&#39;s crime.
The nooses? I don&#39;t even know why they were there, what they were
supposed to mean. There&#39;s pranks all the time, of one type or another,
going on. And it just didn&#39;t seem to be racist to me.&quot;<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-09-18 | Tuesday</font></strong><br><br>we&#39;re off to the <u><strong><a href="http://www.atlantismusic.com/">Atlantis Music Festival</a></strong></u> tomorrow.&nbsp; should be phat. there&#39;s supposed to be over 300 different artists playing the showcase.&nbsp; we&#39;ll take some pictures and post up for ya&#39;ll.&nbsp; stay posted!<br /><br />saba<br /> <p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-09-17 | Monday</font></strong><br><br>summer is on it&#39;s way out and the gloom of fall and school is beginning to set in.  it&#39;s that time again to break out the cardigans and corn cob pipes... well, at least for me. <br /><br />one of things i like to do when i&#39;m flossin Ivy League style is bump my <strong>Threat Of Beauty</strong> album.  well, i dunno if Evan called it an album to me or a demo of cuts recorded live, but as far as i&#39;m concerned this is album material.<br /><br />Threat Of Beauty is a quartet from Seattle that has evolved to take several different forms:  the bare bones to the 23 piece ensemble.  The main members are Seattle based musicians <strong>Evan Flory-Barnes </strong>on double bass, <strong>Eric Peters</strong> on drums, <strong>Dylan Rieck</strong> on cello, and <strong>Jacques Willis</strong> on vibraphone.<br /><br />ya&#39;ll might remember Evan from when he collabed with <strong>Ahamefule Oluo </strong>for the <strong>MASSLINE X New Seattle Orchestra Show</strong> we had at the Langston Hughes awhile back.<br /><br />
<u><strong><a href="http://www.threatofbeauty.com/">Threat Of Beauty Website</a></strong></u><br /><br />one of their tracks is available for download at your upper right.  enjoy.<br /><br />saba<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-09-15 | Saturday</font></strong><br><br><img src="http://niralimagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2006/09/mia-2.jpg" alt="" width="350" height="451" /><br /><br />X<br /><br /><img src="http://photos.lacoccinelle.net/60/58/236058.jpg" alt="" width="357" height="273" /><br /><br />X<br /><br /><img src="http://www.blender.com/gallery_photos/25Reasons/richboy.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="300" /><br /><br />MIA - Paper Planes (remix) feat. Bun B and Rich Boy:<br /><br />http://www.mediafire.com/?9xwzsddngyd<br /><br />Peace<br />daps1<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><center><div class="pagenumbers"><A HREF="archive.php?from=75">[&lt;&lt;]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=0">[1]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=5">[2]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=10">[3]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=15">[4]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=20">[5]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=25">[6]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=30">[7]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=35">[8]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=40">[9]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=45">[10]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=50">[11]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=55">[12]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=60">[13]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=65">[14]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=70">[15]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=75">[16]</A> [17] <A HREF="archive.php?from=85">[18]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=90">[19]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=95">[20]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=100">[21]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=105">[22]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=110">[23]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=115">[24]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=120">[25]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=125">[26]</A> 